# Editable instances share immutable model geometry, never mutable articulation.
import scene_instance_types.dl

to [refresh UI scene instance] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    if (instance's pending) = false:
        return nothing
    set root to the UI scene matrix for (instance's root pose)
    set index to 0
    for each part in (instance's model's parts):
        set parent to part's parent
        if parent >= 0:
            if the item at parent in (instance's dirty):
                replace item at index index in (instance's dirty) with true
        if the item at index in (instance's dirty):
            set base to root
            if parent >= 0:
                set base to (the item at parent in (instance's placements))'s transform's matrix
            set local to the UI scene matrix for (the item at index in (instance's poses))
            set placement to the item at index in (instance's placements)
            set placement's transform to a UI scene transform from (the graphics product of base and local)
            set placement's visible to the item at index in (instance's visibility)
            set placement's pickable to the item at index in (instance's pickability)
            if parent >= 0:
                set previous to the item at parent in (instance's placements)
                set placement's visible to placement's visible and previous's visible
                set placement's pickable to placement's pickable and previous's pickable
            set placement's present to (the length of part's mesh's indices) > 0
            if placement's present:
                set placement's bounds to the UI scene bounds of (part's mesh's bounds) through (placement's transform)
            increment placement's revision
            replace item at index index in (instance's placements) with placement
        increment index
    set extent to a new UI scene extent
    set index to 0
    for each placement in (instance's placements):
        if (placement's visible) and (placement's present):
            include UI scene bounds (placement's bounds) in (the address of extent)
        replace item at index index in (instance's dirty) with false
        increment index
    set instance's extent to extent
    set instance's pending to false
    increment instance's revision

to get [a UI scene instance of] {UI scene model:model}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI scene instance)
    set result's model to model
    set result's poses to an empty list of UI scene pose
    set result's materials to an empty list of UI scene material
    set result's visibility to an empty list of a boolean
    set result's pickability to an empty list of a boolean
    set result's dirty to an empty list of a boolean
    set result's placements to an empty list of UI scene placement
    set result's root pose to an identity UI scene pose
    set placeholder to a new UI scene placement
    set placeholder's transform to a UI scene transform from (an identity graphics matrix)
    for each part in model's parts:
        append (part's pose) to (result's poses)
        append (part's material) to (result's materials)
        append (part's visible) to (result's visibility)
        append (part's pickable) to (result's pickability)
        append true to (result's dirty)
        append placeholder to (result's placements)
    set result's pending to true
    refresh UI scene instance result
    return result

to get [the UI scene placement of part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    refresh UI scene instance instance
    return the item at index in (instance's placements)

to [close UI scene instance] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    free instance's poses
    free instance's materials
    free instance's visibility
    free instance's pickability
    free instance's dirty
    free instance's placements
    destroy the value at instance
    deallocate instance
